sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Student Client
    participant API as Express API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    S->>API: POST /attempts/start assignmentId
    API->>DB: Validate + INSERT attempt
    API-->>S: questions no isCorrect
    loop Each answer change
        S->>API: PUT /attempts/:id/answers
        API->>DB: UPDATE attempt_answers
    end
    S->>API: POST /attempts/:id/submit
    API->>DB: Transaction grade + SUBMITTED
    API-->>S: score, review
